<title>JAPAN: Biwako Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Biwako Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    23.14		vs	   28.73</p>
<p> Operating	    4.65		vs	    5.41</p>
<p> Current		1.39		vs	    2.56</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.35		vs   prft 847 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 12.83 yen	  vs     prft 8.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     105 million	 vs	  105 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Biwako Bank Ltd is a regional bank based in Shiga prefecture.</p>
